            "label": "Compact format"
          }
        },
        "feature1": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A clever fit for your towels.",
            "text": "The square chamber holds up to 12 mini facecloths or 6 regular towels, depending on their size. The product image recommends damp or partially wet towels.",
            "image_id": "75346752209242",
            "image_position": 8
          }
        },
        "feature2": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Compact parts. Simple placement.",
            "text": "The removable chamber sits above the heating base, with a front dial and easy-to-lift lid. Allow the unit to cool before moving it or handling removable parts.",
            "image_id": "75346752110938",
            "image_position": 5
          }
        },
        "feature3": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A warm addition to your routine.",
            "text": "Use the steamer for compatible towel-care and spa routines as directed in the product manual. An insulated handle and overheat protection are included in the listed features.",
            "image_id": "75346752176474",
            "image_position": 7
          }
        },
        "faq1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does warming take?",
            "answer": "The product description lists approximately 10–15 minutes. Towel quantity, size and starting conditions can affect the result."
          }
        },
        "faq2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should towels be prepared?",
            "answer": "The uploaded capacity image recommends damp or partially wet towels. Follow the manual for water level, loading and safe handling; hot steam and surfaces require care."
          }
        }
      },
